830/0573/5193/files/Product-Armor-28-Ultra-41.webp\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/Product-Armor-28-Ultra-42.webp\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/Product-Armor-28-Ultra-43.webp\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/Product-Armor-28-Ultra-44.webp\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/Product-Armor-28-Ultra-45.webp\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/Product-Armor-28-Ultra-46.webp\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/Product-Armor-28-Ultra-47.webp\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/Product-Armor-28-Ultra-48.webp\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/Product-Armor-28-Ultra-49.webp\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/Product-Armor-28-Ultra-50.webp\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/Product-Armor-28-Ultra-51.webp\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/Product-Armor-28-Ultra-52.webp\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n\n    <div class=\"notes container\" style=\"padding: 2% 0;line-height: 2;width: 80%;margin: 0 auto;text-align: left;\">\n        <h5 style=\"text-align: left;\">Notes:</h5>\n        <p>1. The battery is non-removable, removing it may cause damage to the device.</p>\n        <p>2. Product size and weight may vary by configuration, manufacturing process and measurements. All specifications are subject to the actual product.</p>\n        <p>3. Armor 28 Ultra is splash, water, and dust resistant and was tested under controlled laboratory conditions with a rating of IP68 under IEC standard 60529 (maximum depth of 2 meters up to 30 minutes). Charger and accessories are not water-resistant. Splash, water and dust resistance are not permanent and might decrease as a result of normal wear. Do not attempt to charge a wet Armor 28 Ultra. Liquid damage not covered under warranty.</p>\n        <p>4. Armor 28 Ultra has waterproof plugs for its charging port and audio jack, please tightly put the plugs into the holes before you put an Armor 28 Ultra into water.</p>\n        <p>5. The Custom Key and its ability to quickly access different functions, except SOS, work only when the phone screen is unlocked.</p>\n        <p>6. The actual available RAM and storage are less than the listed total capacity due to the occupied storage of the operating system and software pre-installed in the device.</p>\n        <p>7. The micro SD card is not included, and need to be purchased separately. It is recommended to use Class 10 memory cards, other types of memory cards are not guaranteed to be fully compatible.</p>\n        <p>8. 6.67 inches is the diagonal length of the main display when the four rounded corners are taken to be pointed corners, the actual viewable area is slightly smaller.</p>\n        <p>9. The resolution is measured as a standard rectangle with a rounded corners design, the effective pixels are slightly less.</p>\n        <p>10. The camera software functions are subject to the actual presence, some of functions and names may vary depending on the software version.</p>\n        <p>11. The actual photo and video resolution may vary depending on the shooting mode.</p>\n        <p>12. NFC and Google Pay is supported, and you are suggested to download Google Pay to use it; the available countries and regions are for your reference: https://pay.google.com/about.</p>\n        <p>13. The product, accessories, and package may vary in different markets. Pictures are for reference only. Please refer to the actual products.</p>\n        <p>14. Whether you can use VoLTE depends on the local carriers, please note that not all of your local carriers support this function.</p>\n        <p>15. The virtual(dynamic) memory can be activated in Settings at your will.</p>\n        <p>16. Datas are from Ulefone lab, the actual performance may vary.</p>\n        <p>17. The wireless charging stand is sold separately.</p>\n        <p>18. The Armor case mentioned above, combined with a back clip and a carabiner in one set is sold separately.</p>\n        <p>19. Sports Armband is sold separately.</p>\n        <p>20. Armor Mount Pro is sold separately.</p>\n        <p>21. For more devices that are compatible with uSmart Expansion Connector, refer to the  accessories list. Expansion devices require additional purchases.</p>\n        <p>22. A rated capacity of 5300mAh at 7.74V is equivalent to 10600mAh capacity. Power consumption data above are from Ulefone lab, which will be varied by actual usage.</p>\n        <p>23. The Armor 28 Ultra Thermal supports OTA updates to Android 16.</p>\n        <p>24. Armor 28 Ultra supports DP1.4 protocol, and a display screen that supports the DP protocol is required for screen casting.</p>\n        <p>25. AI Removal and Background are on-device AI, enhanced by cloud AI online. Other features use cloud AI without data storage.</p>\n        <p>26. The AI Digital Human and AI Photography features offer a complimentary limit of 20 productions daily. Any production beyond this limit will incur additional charges.</p>\n        <p>27. The sub screen's watch face is for demonstration only, please refer to its actual.</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"sec-block\" style=\"margin-top: 15%;\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/Product-Armor-28-Ultra-01.webp\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/Product-Armor-28-Ultra-02.webp\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n    <img src=