s, other types of memory cards are not guaranteed to be fully compatible.</p>\n        <p>8. 6.67 inches is the diagonal length of the main display when the four rounded corners are taken to be pointed corners, the actual viewable area is slightly smaller.</p>\n        <p>9. The resolution is measured as a standard rectangle with a rounded corners design, the effective pixels are slightly less.</p>\n        <p>10. The camera software functions are subject to the actual presence, some of functions and names may vary depending on the software version.</p>\n        <p>11. The actual photo and video resolution may vary depending on the shooting mode.</p>\n        <p>12. NFC and Google Pay is supported, and you are suggested to download Google Pay to use it; the available countries and regions are for your reference: https://pay.google.com/about.</p>\n        <p>13. The product, accessories, and package may vary in different markets. Pictures are for reference only. Please refer to the actual products.</p>\n        <p>14. Whether you can use VoLTE depends on the local carriers, please note that not all of your local carriers support this function.</p>\n        <p>15. The virtual(dynamic) memory can be activated in Settings at your will.</p>\n        <p>16. Datas are from Ulefone lab, the actual performance may vary.</p>\n        <p>17. The wireless charging stand is sold separately.</p>\n        <p>18. The Armor case mentioned above, combined with a back clip and a carabiner in one set is sold separately.</p>\n        <p>19. Sports Armband is sold separately.</p>\n        <p>20. Armor Mount Pro is sold separately.</p>\n        <p>21. For more devices that are compatible with uSmart Expansion Connector, refer to the  accessories list. Expansion devices require additional purchases.</p>\n        <p>22. A rated capacity of 5300mAh at 7.74V is equivalent to 10600mAh capacity. Power consumption data above are from Ulefone lab, which will be varied by actual usage.</p>\n        <p>23. The Armor 28 Ultra Thermal supports OTA updates to Android 16.</p>\n        <p>24. Armor 28 Ultra supports DP1.4 protocol, and a display screen that supports the DP protocol is required for screen casting.</p>\n        <p>25. AI Removal and Background are on-device AI, enhanced by cloud AI online. Other features use cloud AI without data storage.</p>\n        <p>26. The AI Digital Human and AI Photography features offer a complimentary limit of 20 productions daily. Any production beyond this limit will incur additional charges.</p>\n        <p>27. The sub screen's watch face is for demonstration only, please refer to its actual.</p>\n    </div>\n</div>"
